WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.612
Welcome to the Green Team Facilitator orientation.

00:00:03.612 --> 00:00:06.800
Guide Green Team's discussion, review the Scribe handoff,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.363
project the working record, and submit the final team

00:00:09.363 --> 00:00:11.088
artifact to White Cell.

00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:14.137
Your workflow moves from framing the discussion, to reviewing

00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:17.012
the Scribe’s record, to projecting and submitting the agreed

00:00:17.012 --> 00:00:18.087
artifact.

00:00:18.087 --> 00:00:22.375
Keep presentation, editing, and submission as separate decisions

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:22.512
.

00:00:22.512 --> 00:00:25.788
The team remains responsible for its judgment, while White

00:00:25.788 --> 00:00:28.250
Cell remains responsible for review.
